# --- agent-kit additions: Windows / Claude Code hygiene ---
# `> nul` under Git Bash creates a real file named `nul` (it is only a
# device name to cmd.exe) — a 928KB stray of exactly this shape was found
# live in the fleet. Redirect to /dev/null instead; this line catches the
# mistake when it happens anyway.
nul
